5e4f5a6b-d69f-48f4-970b-7a16d125443c-0
00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:10.120
This is going to be a very basic document.

7d5c405b-240f-42ae-b022-db169a8af441-0
00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:15.600
I it's just basically mirroring HIPAA
onto the program.

49ccd06d-fcc3-4e63-a5e3-7e665d828601-0
00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:16.760
The purpose?

1e352d88-b7c7-42c9-b63f-68ec6b96c6b0-0
00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:20.971
To protect patient safety and ensure
program integrity and promote equitable

1e352d88-b7c7-42c9-b63f-68ec6b96c6b0-1
00:06:20.971 --> 00:06:24.855
access to care by establishing clear
confidentiality standards for all

1e352d88-b7c7-42c9-b63f-68ec6b96c6b0-2
00:06:24.855 --> 00:06:28.520
licensed entities participating in the
medical psilocybin program.

87599ab3-3fb3-43e6-9c1d-fb4c9f713669-0
00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:31.920
So our recommendation is to the Board
that they adopt these standards.

16de8cdf-7a5b-4f9a-a169-fdfc74e7db34-0
00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:34.280
So our HIPAA Alliance standards.

c19f16e2-e375-482c-8cad-f14bcca45668-0
00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:38.608
Licensees should implement and adhere to
privacy protections consistent with the

c19f16e2-e375-482c-8cad-f14bcca45668-1
00:06:38.608 --> 00:06:42.527
standards established under the Health
Insurance Portability and Accountability

c19f16e2-e375-482c-8cad-f14bcca45668-2
00:06:42.527 --> 00:06:44.879
Act of 1996,
regardless of whether the licensee

c19f16e2-e375-482c-8cad-f14bcca45668-3
00:06:44.879 --> 00:06:47.280
qualifies as a covered entity under
federal law.

d7c0dd67-10dd-4c41-83cd-3c0881d9a0a4-0
00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:51.517
Licensees should not use or disclose
patient identifying information except as

d7c0dd67-10dd-4c41-83cd-3c0881d9a0a4-1
00:06:51.517 --> 00:06:55.370
permitted or required under HIPAA aligned
privacy standards or pursuant to valid

d7c0dd67-10dd-4c41-83cd-3c0881d9a0a4-2
00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:59.080
legal process, including a court order,
warrant, or lawfully issued subpoena.

3aaedb4c-bbe3-4739-a93e-9b6471fb0e1f-0
00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:03.740
Licensees should not disclose patient
information in response to informal,

3aaedb4c-bbe3-4739-a93e-9b6471fb0e1f-1
00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:07.421
voluntary or non compulsory requests,
including requests from law enforcement

3aaedb4c-bbe3-4739-a93e-9b6471fb0e1f-2
00:07:07.421 --> 00:07:09.640
that are not supported by valid legal
process.

5682403d-1ccc-49c0-b325-ffaec2ffcd36-0
00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:14.869
The minimum necessary standard is that
all disclosures should be limited to the

